        <Key ID="STR_einv_arsenal_Setting_BIArsenal_Desc">
            <English>What happens when something opens the\nvanilla Virtual Arsenal - the scroll\naction of a box, a script or Zeus.\n\nOpen the Enhanced Arsenal: the same\nitems, in this mod's window. Missions\nthat change the vanilla one with their\nown scripts keep it.\nNot allowed: a red screen says the\nVirtual Arsenal is not allowed here.\nLeave it alone: the vanilla one opens,\nwithout grids.\n\nZeus is never stopped. The Eden editor,\nthe main menu's Virtual Arsenal and\nWarlords always keep the vanilla one.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_einv_arsenal_Setting_BIArsenal_Enhanced">
            <English>Open the Enhanced Arsenal</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_einv_arsenal_Setting_BIArsenal_Vanilla">
            <English>Leave it alone</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_einv_arsenal_Setting_BIMessage">
            <English>Message when not allowed</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_einv_arsenal_Setting_BIMessage_Desc">
            <English>Shown under "not allowed" on the red\nscreen - where players get their gear\ninstead, say.\n\nEmpty shows nothing more.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_einv_arsenal_Setting_ConfirmUnique">
            <English>Ask before throwing things away</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_einv_arsenal_Setting_ConfirmUnique_Desc">
            <English>Giving back something this arsenal\ndoes not have throws it away for good.\nWith this on, that only happens on the\nsecond click.\n\nWhat the arsenal has goes back at once.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_einv_arsenal_Setting_QuickAddAmount">
            <English>Shift+Ctrl+click adds</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_einv_arsenal_Setting_QuickAddAmount_Desc">
            <English>How many of an item Shift+Ctrl+click\nadds from the arsenal at once.\n\nCtrl+click alone always adds one.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_einv_arsenal_Setting_Window">
            <English>Arsenal window</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_einv_arsenal_Setting_Window_Ace">
            <English>ACE Arsenal</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_einv_arsenal_Setting_Window_Desc">
            <English>Which window opens for ACE Arsenal\nboxes, Zeus and scripts.\n\nEnhanced Arsenal: the arsenal in this\nmod's window, with its grids.\nACE Arsenal: ACE's own window.\n\nThe Enhanced Arsenal has a button to\nswitch to ACE's. The Eden editor offers\nboth in its Arsenal menu.</English>
        </Key>
